          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does 05+ stand for?",
            "answer": "<p>05+ means \"starting from zero, adding what's good.\" The brand philosophy is about enriching everyday life with products that are safe, thoughtfully designed, and backed by science — nothing harmful, nothing unnecessary.</p>"
