          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the ultrasonic pest repellers safe around babies?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our multi-frequency ultrasonic pest repellers use purely physical principles with no chemicals or harmful radiation. They are safe for use around pregnant women, infants, toddlers, and pets.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the EWG Green Grade rating?",
            "answer": "<p>EWG (Environmental Working Group) is an independent US-based research organisation that rates products on ingredient safety. EWG Green Grade means the product uses only ingredients rated as safe and low-risk for human health and the environment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the vacuum seal storage extend food life?",
            "answer": "<p>05+ vacuum seal storage uses patented negative-pressure technology to remove oxygen from the container, dramatically slowing oxidation and bacterial growth — extending freshness 2–3x compared to conventional storage.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the 05+ pet shampoo safe for all breeds?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The 05+ EWG-certified pet care range is formulated without sulphates, parabens, or artificial fragrances — safe for all dog and cat breeds, including puppies and senior animals.</p>"
          }
        },
